# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Filinvest Commercial Lots Properties Explorer — Environment
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# All variables are optional. Anything prefixed VITE_ is embedded in the
# client bundle and visible to users — never put secrets here.

# VITE_PUBLIC_URL (optional)
# Public URL of your deployed site, encoded in the landing-screen
# "Scan to open on mobile" QR code. If empty, the QR code points to the
# address the app is currently served from.
VITE_PUBLIC_URL=""
